  ShadowDensity: 1.000000
  Text: |-
    Sync Kit Basic Example is a Connected Lens: small examples of how Sync Kit shares objects, properties and events with everyone in a session.
    
    Pinch Multiplayer to join a shared session with people nearby, or Solo to try it on your own.
    
    Then step through the examples with Previous and Next on the panel below them.
